{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#1014","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#1014","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#1014\",\"parent_revision\":\"2eb830689a39f219d09b7c3af5d6698fa34251731c7f82d0316cb06fb0e579ff\",\"root_revision\":\"2eb830689a39f219d09b7c3af5d6698fa34251731c7f82d0316cb06fb0e579ff\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P1\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: 2026-04-12\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\ngroup-items-to-milestone/SKILL.md Step 7 ends with \\\"Next step: /start-milestone {number}\\\" but /start-milestone is a project-level skill at .claude/skills/start-milestone/, not a plugin skill. The correct next step based on the workflow documentation is /groom-milestone. This stale reference sends users to a potentially non-existent or wrong skill.\\n\\nFound by codebase-analyzer during #1010 grooming (concern #5).\\n\\n## RT-ICA\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nRT-ICA Final: fix: group-items-to-milestone SKILL.md references non-existent /start-milestone skill\\nDate: 2026-04-24\\nGoal: Update stale next-step reference to correct skill in the milestone workflow chain\\n\\nConditions:\\n1. group-items-to-milestone/SKILL.md line 113 contains stale reference | Status: AVAILABLE | Citation: grep confirmed \\\"Next step: /start-milestone {number}\\\" at line 113\\n2. /start-milestone skill exists at .claude/skills/start-milestone/ | Status: AVAILABLE | Citation: ls .claude/skills/start-milestone/SKILL.md exits 0\\n3. /dh:groom-milestone skill exists at plugins/development-harness/skills/groom-milestone/ | Status: AVAILABLE | Citation: find confirmed SKILL.md at that path; description says \\\"Requires milestone items assigned via /group-items-to-milestone\\\"\\n4. /dh:groom-milestone is the correct next step (group \u2192 groom \u2192 work-milestone) | Status: AVAILABLE | Citation: groom-milestone description confirms intended sequence; old blocker